# Normalize line endings to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
# eol=lf applies on checkout as well, including on Windows — this is deliberate:
# files that run inside Linux containers (shell scripts, entrypoints,
# Dockerfiles) must never carry CRLF, and current Windows editors and tools
# handle LF without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
